      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "POWER EDITION (2) hit the ground running last start and was never headed to land his maiden success over 410m at this track (23.58). Nicely drawn here. Can measure up again. FUNKY KONG (8) was quickly out of the boxes with a slick early sectional clocking 22.54 with a 1.3 lengths win at Shepparton over 390m. Capable of going well again. ARTEMIS SCIENCE (4) had the drop on the lead from the rails draw last start but could only manage second, beaten 2.75 lengths (23.62) at this track in a Grade 7 over 410m. Bold showing expected. JUNO USKO (5) was strongly fancied last time on the back of a win two back but could only manage second (22.40) at Warrnambool. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten.",
